| Plan | Cost | Minutes | Per-Min | Knowledge Base |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Starter** | $15/mo | ~179 min | $0.084 | 5 MB |
| **Jump Starter** | $30/mo | ~395 min | $0.076 | 10 MB |
