| **Growth** | $200/mo | ~3571 min | $0.056 | 100 MB |
| **Enterprise** | Custom | Custom | ~$0.04 | Custom |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Recommendation: Start with "Early Deployers" plan at $36/month.**
> 
> Reasons:
> - Best value at 10% discount ($0.068/min vs $0.084 on Starter)
> - ~588 minutes is enough for initial loan advisory calling campaigns
> - 50 MB Knowledge Base lets you upload all loan product details
> - You already have Twilio, so you save on phone number costs

#### Can You Connect Your Twilio Account?

**YES** — OmniDim supports **Bring Your Own Twilio (BYOT)**. Here's the step-by-step:

##### Step 1: Get Your Twilio Credentials
1. Go to [Twilio Console](https://console.twilio.com/)
2. From the dashboard, copy:
   - **Account SID**: `your_twilio_account_sid_here` (you already have this)
   - **Auth Token**: (get from Twilio Console → Account Info)

##### Step 2: Set Up OmniDim Account
1. Go to [omnidim.io/signup](https://omnidim.io/signup) and create an account
2. Choose the **Early Deployers** plan ($36/month)
3. Complete billing setup

##### Step 3: Connect Twilio to OmniDim
1. Log into OmniDim dashboard → **Settings** (left sidebar)
2. Navigate to **Integrations** or **Phone Numbers** section
3. Look for **"Import Phone Number"** or **"Bring Your Own Carrier"** option
4. Select **Twilio** as the provider
5. Enter your credentials:
   - **Account SID**: `your_twilio_account_sid_here`
   - **Auth Token**: Your Twilio auth token
6. Click **Connect** / **Verify**

##### Step 4: Import Your Twilio Phone Number
1. After connecting, OmniDim will list your Twilio phone numbers
2. Select your number: `+91 7249108474` (or your preferred number)
3. Click **Import** — OmniDim will configure the SIP trunk/webhook automatically

##### Step 5: Create Your Voice AI Agent
1. Go to OmniDim dashboard → **Create Agent**
2. Describe your agent: *"Loan advisory agent for Avani Loan Services. Helps customers with Personal Loan, Business Loan, Doctor Loan, Home Loan, Mortgage Loan, and Education Loan inquiries."*
3. Configure:
   - **Voice**: Choose an Indian English voice
   - **Language**: English + Hindi
   - **Knowledge Base**: Upload your loan product details
   - **Phone Number**: Select the Twilio number you imported

##### Step 6: Set Up Webhook for CRM Integration
1. In OmniDim → Agent Settings → **Webhooks**
2. Add your CRM webhook URL: `https://avani-ai-crm.vercel.app/api/vapi-webhook`
3. Select events: `call.completed`, `call.failed`, `transcript.ready`
4. This will automatically update your CRM when calls complete

##### Step 7: Launch Bulk Calls
1. Go to OmniDim → **Bulk Call** (left sidebar)
2. Upload your CSV with columns: Name, Phone, Loan Type
3. Select your AI Agent
4. Click **Start Campaign**

> [!TIP]
> Since you already pay for Twilio, your per-minute cost on OmniDim will be the **platform fee only** ($0.068/min on Early Deployers plan). The Twilio telephony cost is separate and charged by Twilio directly at their rates (~₹0.50/min for India).

